<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">I Jean</para>
  <para style="toc1">PREMYE LÈT JEAN</para>
  <para style="toc2">I Jean</para>
  <para style="toc3">I Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">I JEAN</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1" />Sa ki te ye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1">Jn 1:1</ref></char></note>depi kòmansman an, sa ke nou te tande, sa ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:16">II Pi 1:16</ref></char></note>te wè avèk zye nou yo, sa ke nou te byen konnen, epi te manyen avèk men nou yo, konsènan Pawòl Lavi a; <verse eid="1JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2" />epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:4">Jn 1:4</ref></char></note>lavi te vin parèt pou l vizib e nou te wè l, epi tande l, epi pwoklame a nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:28">Jn 10:28</ref></char></note>lavi etènèl la, ki te avèk Papa a, epi te fè parèt byen klè a nou.<verse eid="1JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3" />Sa ke nou te wè epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:20">Trav 4:20</ref></char></note>tande, nou pwoklame a nou menm osi ke nou kapab genyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:3">Jn 17:3</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 17:21">21</ref></char></note>kominyon avèk nou. Konsa vrèman, kominyon nou se avèk Papa a, epi avèk Fis Li, Jésus Kri. <verse eid="1JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:1">I Jn 2:1</ref></char></note>bagay sa yo nou ekri, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:29">Jn 3:29</ref></char></note>lajwa nou kapab vin konplèt.<verse eid="1JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5" />Men mesaj la ke nou te tande a Li, epi te anonse a nou menm, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:16">I Tim 6:16</ref></char></note>Bondye se limyè, epi nan Li nanpwen tenèb ditou.<verse eid="1JN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jn 8:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Si nou di ke nou gen kominyon avè Li, men nou mache nan tenèb la, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:4">I Jn 2:4</ref></char></note>manti epi pa pratike laverite a. <verse eid="1JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7" />Men si nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:5">Esd 2:5</ref></char></note>mache nan limyè a, menm jan ke Li menm se nan limyè a, nou gen kominyon youn avèk lòt, epi san a Jésus, Fis Li, netwaye nou de tout peche.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:16">I Tim 6:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="1JN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:14">Job 15:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Si nou di ke nou pa gen peche, n ap pase pwòp tèt nou nan desepsyon, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:44">Jn 8:44</ref></char></note>laverite a pa nan nou. <verse eid="1JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:5">Sòm 32:5</ref></char></note>Si nou konfese peche nou yo, Li se fidèl epi jis pou padonnen nou peche nou yo, epi pou netwaye nou de tout mal.<verse eid="1JN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:14">Job 15:14</ref></char></note>si nou di ke nou pa peche, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:10">I Jn 5:10</ref></char></note>fè Li menm yon mantè, epi pawòl Li pa nan nou.<verse eid="1JN 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1" />Pitit mwen yo, m ap ekri nou bagay sa yo pou nou pa peche. Si nenpòt peche <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:34">Wo 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:16">Jn 14:16</ref></char></note>nou gen yon avoka avèk Papa a, Jésus Kri sila ki dwat. <verse eid="1JN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2" />Se Li menm ki sakrifis ekspiyatwa a pou peche nou yo, non sèlman pou nou, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:42">Jn 4:42</ref></char></note>pou tout lemonn lan.<verse eid="1JN 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3" />Se konsa nou konnen ke nou gen tan konnen Li, si nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:15">Jn 14:15</ref></char></note>kenbe kòmandman Li yo. <verse eid="1JN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4" />Sila ki di “Mwen gen tan konnen Li,” men pa kenbe kòmandman Li yo, se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 1:6">I Jn 1:6</ref></char></note>mantè, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 1:8">I Jn 1:8</ref></char></note>laverite a pa nan li. <verse eid="1JN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5" />Men nenpòt ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:23">Jn 14:23</ref></char></note>kenbe pawòl Li, nan li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:12">I Jn 4:12</ref></char></note>lamou Bondye a vrèman gen tan vin konplete. Men ki jan nou konnen ke nou se nan li: <verse eid="1JN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6" />Sila ki di ke l ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:4">Jn 15:4</ref></char></note>reste nan Li ta dwe, li menm, mache menm jan ke Li te mache.<verse eid="1JN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7" />Byeneme yo, mwen p ap ekri yon kòmandman nèf a nou, men yon ansyen kòmandman ke nou te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:24">I Jn 2:24</ref></char></note>depi kòmansman an. Lansyen kòmandman an se pawòl a ke nou te tande depi kòmansman an. <verse eid="1JN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8" />Sou lòt men, m ap ekri nou yon kòmandman nèf, ki se vrè nan Li, epi nan nou, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:12">Wo 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:9">Jn 1:9</ref></char></note>tenèb la ap pase, epi vrè limyè a ap briye deja. <verse eid="1JN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9" />Sila ki di ke li nan limyè a, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:11">I Jn 2:11</ref></char></note>rayi frè l se nan tenèb la jiska prezan. <verse eid="1JN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:9">Jn 11:9</ref></char></note>Sila ki renmen frè li se nan limyè a, epi pa gen kòz pou chite tonbe nan li. <verse eid="1JN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11" />Men sila ki rayi frè li se nan tenèb la, epi mache nan tenèb la. Li pa konnen kote l ap w ale, paske tenèb la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:4">II Kor 4:4</ref></char></note>fin fè l avèg.<verse eid="1JN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12" />M ap ekri nou, ti moun yo, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:38">Trav 13:38</ref></char></note>peche nou yo gen tan padonnen pou kòz a non Li. <verse eid="1JN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13" />M ap ekri nou, papa yo, paske nou konnen Li ki te la depi kòmansman an. M ap ekri nou jenn nonm yo, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:33">Jn 16:33</ref></char></note>nou te vin gen viktwa la sou sila ki mechan. Mwen te ekri nou ti moun yo, paske nou konnen Papa a. <verse eid="1JN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14" />Mwen te ekri nou, papa yo, paske nou konnen Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 1:1">I Jn 1:1</ref></char></note>ki te la depi kòmansman a. Mwen te ekri nou jenn nonm yo paske nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:10">Ef 6:10</ref></char></note>gen fòs, epi pawòl Bondye a reste nan nou, epi nou te vin gen viktwa sou sila ki mechan.<verse eid="1JN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15" />Pa renmen lemonn, ni bagay yo ki nan lemonn. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:4">Jc 4:4</ref></char></note>Si nenpòt renmen lemonn, lamou Papa a pa reste nan li. <verse eid="1JN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16" />Paske tout sa ki nan lemonn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:14">Wo 13:14</ref></char></note>lanvi lachè a, lanvi nan zye yo, ak lògey lavi la pa sòti nan Papa a, men nan lemonn sa. <verse eid="1JN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:31">I Kor 7:31</ref></char></note>Men lemonn an disparèt avèk tout lanvi li yo, men sila ki fè volonte a Bondye ap viv jis pou janmen.<verse eid="1JN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18" />Pitit yo, se dènye lè. Menm jan ke nou te tande ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:5">Mat 24:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:24">24</ref></char></note>antikris la ap vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:22">Mc 13:22</ref></char></note>menm koulye a anpil antikris yo gen tan leve. Pou sa, nou konnen ke se dènye lè. <verse eid="1JN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:30">Trav 20:30</ref></char></note>Yo te sòti pami nou, men yo pa t vrèman nan nou, paske si yo te nan nou, yo t ap rete avèk nou. Men yo te sòti jis pou li ta kapab vin klè ke yo pa nan nou.<verse eid="1JN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20" />Men nou menm gen lonksyon lan ki sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mc 1:24</ref></char></note>Sila ki Sen an, epi nou tout konnen sa. <verse eid="1JN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21" />Mwen pa t ekri nou akoz nou pa konnen verite a, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:19">Jc 1:19</ref></char></note>paske nou konnen li, epi akoz ke okenn manti pa janm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:44">Jn 8:44</ref></char></note>sòti nan laverite a. <verse eid="1JN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22" />Kilès k ap manti, sòf ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:3">I Jn 4:3</ref></char></note>li menm ki demanti ke Jésus se Kris la. Sila se antikris la, sila ki refize Papa a ansanm ak Fis la. <verse eid="1JN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:19">Jn 8:19</ref></char></note>Sila ki demanti Fis la pa gen Papa a. Sila ki konfese Fis la, anplis, gen Papa a.<verse eid="1JN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24" />Pou nou menm, kite sa demere nan nou ke nou te tande depi kòmansman an. Si sa nou te tande depi kòmansman an demere nan nou, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:23">Jn 14:23</ref></char></note>va osi reste nan Fis la, ak Papa a. <verse eid="1JN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:15">Jn 3:15</ref></char></note>sa se pwomès la ke Li menm te fè nou, lavi etènèl.<verse eid="1JN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26" />Bagay sa yo mwen te ekri nou konsènan sa yo ki ta eseye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:7">I Jn 3:7</ref></char></note>pase nou nan desepsyon. <verse eid="1JN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27" />Epi pou nou menm, lonksyon ke nou te resevwa a Li demere nan nou, epi nou pa gen bezwen pou pèsòn enstwi nou; men lonksyon Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:26">Jn 14:26</ref></char></note>enstwi nou nan tout bagay. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:17">Jn 14:17</ref></char></note>Li se verite, epi pa janm nan manti, menm jan ke li te enstwi nou, demere nan Li. <verse eid="1JN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28" />Epi koulye a, ti moun yo, reste nan Li, jis pou lè L <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:2">I Jn 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mc 8:38</ref></char></note>vin parèt, nou kapab gen konfyans epi pa vin piti ak wont lè Li vini. <verse eid="1JN 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29" />Si nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:18">Jn 7:18</ref></char></note>Li dwat nèt, nou konnen osi ke tout moun ki pratike ladwati a se ne a Li.<verse eid="1JN 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1" />Gade <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Jn 3:16</ref></char></note>ki grand amou Papa a te bay nou ke nou ta vin rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:12">Jn 1:12</ref></char></note>ti moun yo a Bondye! Konsa, se sa nou ye. Pou rezon sa lemonn pa rekonèt nou, paske li pa t rekonèt Li.<verse eid="1JN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2" />Alò, chè zanmi yo, nou se ti moun a Bondye, epi li poko fin devwale ki sa n ap ye. Nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:29">Wo 8:29</ref></char></note>lè Li parèt nou va tankou Li, paske nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:24">Jn 17:24</ref></char></note>wè Li menm jan ke Li ye. <verse eid="1JN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3" />Epi tout moun ki gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:12">Wo 15:12</ref></char></note>espwa sa sou Li, vin pi li menm, menm jan ak Li.<verse eid="1JN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4" />Epi tout moun ki pratike peche, transgrese lalwa. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:15">Wo 4:15</ref></char></note>Peche a se transgresyon lalwa. <verse eid="1JN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5" />Nou konnen ke Li te parèt pou Li ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:29">Jn 1:29</ref></char></note>retire peche yo, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:21">II Kor 5:21</ref></char></note>nan Li pa gen peche. <verse eid="1JN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6" />Okenn moun ki rete nan Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:9">I Jn 3:9</ref></char></note>pa peche, men okenn ki viv nan peche pa t wè Li, ni yo pa konnen Li.<verse eid="1JN 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7" />Ti moun yo, pa kite pèsòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:26">I Jn 2:26</ref></char></note>twonpe nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:29">I Jn 2:29</ref></char></note>Sila ki pratike ladwati a se jis, menm jan ke Li jis. <verse eid="1JN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8" />Men sila ki pratike peche se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:44">Jn 8:44</ref></char></note>a dyab la, paske dyab la te peche depi kòmansman a. Fis a Bondye te parèt pou rezon sila, ke Li ta kapab detwi zèv a dyab yo.<verse eid="1JN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9" />Nanpwen pèsòn ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:13">Jn 1:13</ref></char></note>ne de Bondye ki pratike peche paske jèm Li tou rete nan li, epi li pa kapab peche, paske li ne a Bondye. <verse eid="1JN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10" />Selon sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:12">Jn 1:12</ref></char></note>pitit a Bondye yo, ak pitit a dyab yo se byen klè. Nenpòt ki pa pratike ladwati a pa de Bondye, ni sila ki pa renmen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:9">I Jn 2:9</ref></char></note>frè li.<verse eid="1JN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11" />Paske sa se mesaj la ke nou te tande depi kòmansman a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Jn 15:12</ref></char></note>ke nou dwe renmen yon lòt. <verse eid="1JN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12" />Pa kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Jen 4:8</ref></char></note>Caïn, ki te apatyen a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:13">I Jn 2:13</ref></char></note>mechan a, epi te asasinen frè l. Men poukisa li te asasinen li? Paske zèv li te mal, epi sa yo a frè l te jis.<verse eid="1JN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13" />Pa etonnen, frè yo, si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:18">Jn 15:18</ref></char></note>lemonn rayi nou.<verse eid="1JN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14" />Nou konnen ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:24">Jn 5:24</ref></char></note>kite lanmò, epi antre nan lavi akoz ke nou renmen frè nou yo. Sila ki pa renmen, rete nan lanmò.<verse eid="1JN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15" />Nenpòt ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:21">Mat 5:21</ref></char></note>rayi frè l se yon asasen. Epi nou konnen ke nanpwen asasen ki gen lavi etènèl a anndan li.<verse eid="1JN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16" />Men konsa nou rekonèt lamou; ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:11">Jn 10:11</ref></char></note>Li te bay vi Li pou nou. Epi konsa, nou ta dwe bay vi nou yo pou frè nou yo. <verse eid="1JN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:15">Jc 2:15</ref></char></note>nenpòt ki gen byen a lemonn sa, pou l wè frè l nan bezwen, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:7">Det 15:7</ref></char></note>sere kè l kontre li, ki jan lamou Bondye kapab rete nan li? <verse eid="1JN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18" />Ti moun yo, pa kite nou renmen avèk pawòl, ni avèk lang, men nan zèv ak nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2JN 1:1">II Jn 1</ref></char></note>verite.<verse eid="1JN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19" />Nou va rekonèt konsa ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:21">I Jn 2:21</ref></char></note>nan laverite, epi va gen asirans nan kè nou devan Li: <verse eid="1JN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20" />si kè nou kondannen nou, Bondye se bokou pi gran ke kè nou, epi Li konnen tout bagay.<verse eid="1JN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21" />Byeneme yo, si kè nou pa kondannen nou, nou gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:28">I Jn 2:28</ref></char></note>konfyans devan Bondye. <verse eid="1JN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22" />Pou sa a, nenpòt ke nou mande, nou va resevwa de Li, paske nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:3">I Jn 2:3</ref></char></note>kenbe kòmandman Li yo, epi fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:29">Jn 8:29</ref></char></note>bagay yo ki fè plezi devan zye Li yo.<verse eid="1JN 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23" />Men sa se kòmandman Li, ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:29">Jn 6:29</ref></char></note>kwè nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:12">Jn 1:12</ref></char></note>non a Fis Li a, Jésus Kri, epi renmen yon lòt, kon Li te kòmande nou.<verse eid="1JN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24" />Sila a ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:3">I Jn 2:3</ref></char></note>kenbe kòmandman Li yo, rete nan Li, epi Li rete nan li menm. Nou konnen konsa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:5">I Jn 2:5</ref></char></note>Li rete nan nou, akoz Li te bay nou Lespri Li.<verse eid="1JN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1" />Byeneme yo, pa kwè tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:8">Jr 29:8</ref></char></note>lespri yo, men sonde yo pou wè si yo sòti nan Bondye, paske anpil fo pwofèt yo gen tan antre nan lemonn.<verse eid="1JN 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2" />Selon sa nou rekonèt Lespri Bondye a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:3">I Kor 12:3</ref></char></note>chak lespri ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:23">I Jn 2:23</ref></char></note>konfese ke Jésus Kri te vini nan lachè a sòti nan Bondye: <verse eid="1JN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3" />Epi chak lespri ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:22">I Jn 2:22</ref></char></note>pa konfese Jésus, pa sòti nan Bondye. Li menm se lespri antikris la, sou kilès nou te tande ke l ap vini, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:3-7">II Tes 2:3-7</ref></char></note>koulye a se deja nan lemonn lan.<verse eid="1JN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4" />Ti moun yo, nou se a Bondye, epi te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:13">I Jn 2:13</ref></char></note>venk lespri sa ki fo, paske pi gran se Li ki nan nou, pase <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:31">Jn 12:31</ref></char></note>li ki nan lemonn an. <verse eid="1JN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:19">Jn 15:19</ref></char></note>Yo sòti nan lemonn an. Akoz sa yo pale tankou lemonn an, epi lemonn an koute yo.<verse eid="1JN 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6" />Nou se a Bondye: li ki konnen Bondye va koute nou. Li ki pa a Bondye p ap koute nou. Pa sa a nou konnen Lespri verite a ak Lespri la a sa ki fo.<verse eid="1JN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7" />Byeneme yo, kite nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:11">I Jn 3:11</ref></char></note>renmen yon ak lòt, paske lamou se ne de Bondye, epi konnen Bondye. <verse eid="1JN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8" />Sila ki pa gen lamou, pa konnen Bondye, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:7">Jn 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 4:16">16</ref></char></note>Bondye se lamou.<verse eid="1JN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9" />Se konsa lamou Bondye te vin parèt nan nou; ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Jn 3:16</ref></char></note>Bondye te voye sèl Fis inik Li nan lemonn an pou nou ta kapab viv nan Li.<verse eid="1JN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10" />Nan sa se lamou; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:8">Wo 5:8</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 5:10">10</ref></char></note>pa ke nou te renmen Bondye, men ke Li te renmen nou, epi te voye Fis Li kon sakrifis pwopiyatwa (sèl sakrifis la ki te akseptab pou peche nou yo).<verse eid="1JN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11" />Byeneme yo, si Bondye te renmen nou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:7">I Jn 4:7</ref></char></note>nou osi dwe renmen youn ak lòt.<verse eid="1JN 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:18">Jn 1:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pèsòn pa janm wè Bondye nan okenn tan. Si nou gen lamou youn pou lòt, Bondye rete nan nou, epi lamou Li vin konplete nan nou.<verse eid="1JN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:9">Wo 8:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Se konsa nou konnen ke nou rete nan Li epi Li nan nou, paske Li te bay nou Lespri Li.<verse eid="1JN 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14" />Konsa, nou gen tan wè epi fè temwen ke Papa a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:17">Jn 3:17</ref></char></note>voye Fis la kòm Sovè lemonn an. <verse eid="1JN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15" />Nenpòt ki konfese ke Jésus se Fis Bondye a, Bondye rete nan li, epi li nan Bondye. <verse eid="1JN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:69">Jn 6:69</ref></char></note>nou vin konnen epi gen tan kwè lamou ke Bondye gen pou nou.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1JN 4:16">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 4:7">I Jn 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="1JN 4:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>Bondye se lamou, epi sila ki rete nan lamou, rete nan Bondye epi Bondye rete nan li. <verse eid="1JN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17" />Se konsa, lamou vin pèfekte avèk nou, pou nou kapab gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:28">I Jn 2:28</ref></char></note>konfyans nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10:15</ref></char></note>jou jijman an; akoz ke menm jan Li ye, nou menm tou se konsa nou ye nan lemonn sa.<verse eid="1JN 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18" />Pa gen lakrent nan lamou; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15">Wo 8:15</ref></char></note>lamou pafè va mete lakrent deyò, paske lakrent gen pinisyon, men sila ki gen perèz pa pèfekte nan lamou.<verse eid="1JN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 4:10">I Jn 4:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nou renmen, paske premyèman Li te renmen nou.<verse eid="1JN 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20" />Si yon moun di ke li renmen Bondye, men li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:9">I Jn 2:9</ref>,<ref loc="1JN 2:11">11</ref></char></note>rayi frè l, li se yon mantè; paske yon moun ki pa renmen frè l ke li kapab wè, pa kapab renmen Bondye ke li pa janm wè. <verse eid="1JN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note>Kòmandman sa a nou gen de Li, ke sila ki renmen Bondye, dwe renmen frè li tou.<verse eid="1JN 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1" />Nenpòt ki kwè ke Jésus se Kris la, se ne a Bondye. Nenpòt ki renmen Papa a, renmen sila ki ne de Li.<verse eid="1JN 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2" />Men konsa nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:14">I Jn 3:14</ref></char></note>nou renmen pitit a Bondye yo, lè nou renmen Bondye, epi obeyi kòmandman Li yo. <verse eid="1JN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:15">Jn 14:15</ref></char></note>se sa ki lamou pou Bondye, ke nou kenbe kòmandman Li yo. Kòmandman Li yo pa di.<verse eid="1JN 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4" />Paske nenpòt ki ne de Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:13">I Jn 2:13</ref></char></note>ap venk lemonn an. Men viktwa ki venk lemonn an—-lafwa nou. <verse eid="1JN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5" />Kilès sila ki venk lemonn an, sòf ke li ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:15">I Jn 4:15</ref></char></note>kwè ke Jésus se Fis a Bondye a?<verse eid="1JN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6" />Se Sila ki vini pa dlo ak san, Jésus Kri; pa sèlman avèk dlo, men avèk dlo ak san. Se Lespri ki pote temwen an, akoz se Lespri a ki verite. <verse eid="1JN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7" />Paske gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat 18:16</ref></char></note>twa ki bay temwen; <verse eid="1JN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8" />Lespri a, dlo a, ak san an; epi tout nan twa sa yo se an akò kon youn sèl.<verse eid="1JN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:34">Jn 5:34</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 5:37">37</ref></char>
    </note>Si nou resevwa temwen lan a lòm, temwen Bondye a pi gran. Paske temwen Bondye a se sa; ke Li te pote temwen konsènan Fis Li. <verse eid="1JN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10" />Sila ki kwè nan Fis a Lòm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:16">Wo 8:16</ref></char></note>gen temwen nan li menm. Men sila ki pa kwè Bondye te fè L yon mantè, akoz ke li pa kwè nan temwen ke Bondye pote konsènan Fis Li.<verse eid="1JN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11" />Temwen a se sa: ke Bondye te bay nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 1:2">I Jn 1:2</ref></char></note>lavi etènèl a, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:4">Jn 1:4</ref></char></note>lavi sila se nan Fis Li. <verse eid="1JN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:15">Jn 3:15</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:36">36</ref></char></note>Li ki gen Fis la, gen lavi. Li ki pa gen Fis a Bondye a pa gen lavi.<verse eid="1JN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 20:31">Jn 20:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bagay sa yo mwen ekri a nou ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:23">I Jn 3:23</ref></char></note>kwè nan non a Fis Bondye a, pou nou kapab konnen ke nou gen lavi etènèl, e ke nou kapab kontinye kwè nan Fis Bondye a.<verse eid="1JN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14" />Sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:28">I Jn 2:28</ref></char></note>konfyans ke nou gen devan Li; ke si nou mande nenpòt bagay selon volonte L, Li tande nou. <verse eid="1JN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15" />Epi si nou konnen ke Li tande nou nan nenpòt sa nou mande, nou konnen ke nou resevwa sa ke nou te mande de Li.<verse eid="1JN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16" />Si nenpòt wè frè l ap fè yon peche ki pa mennen a lanmò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:15">Jc 5:15</ref></char></note>li va mande, epi Bondye va pou li menm, bay lavi a sa yo ki fè peche ki pa mennen a lanmò. Genyen yon peche ki mennen a lanmò. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:16">Jr 7:16</ref></char></note>Mwen pa di ke li dwe fè demann pou sila. <verse eid="1JN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:4">I Jn 3:4</ref></char></note>Tout inikite se peche, epi gen peche ki pa mennen a lanmò.<verse eid="1JN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18" />Nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:9">I Jn 3:9</ref></char></note>okenn ki ne a Bondye fè peche; men Li ki te ne de Bondye a kenbe li menm, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:13">I Jn 2:13</ref></char></note>mechan an p ap touche li.<verse eid="1JN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19" />Nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:6">I Jn 4:6</ref></char></note>nou menm se a Bondye, epi tout lemonn an rete nan pwisans a mechan an.<verse eid="1JN 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20" />Nou konnen ke Fis Bondye a gen tan vini, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:45">Luc 24:45</ref></char></note>bay nou konprann pou nou ta kapab konnen Li ki se vrè. Konsa, nou nan Li ki se vrè, nan Fis Li, Jésus Kri. Sa se vrè Bondye a epi lavi etènèl la.<verse eid="1JN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21" />Ti moun yo, veye nou kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:7">I Kor 10:7</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 10:14">14</ref></char></note>zidòl yo.<verse eid="1JN 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5" />
</usx>